        heading: 'What a cosmetics marketing agency in Chennai should test first: wear in the heat',
        paragraphs: [
          'Makeup in Chennai faces a hard test every day. Humidity, sweat and strong sun break down a base, smudge kajal and fade lip colour, and wedding days often run from an early muhurtham to a late reception. Buyers here have learned to distrust long-wear promises, so a claim on its own does little. What persuades them is proof shot in the same conditions they live in.',
          'A cosmetics marketing agency in Chennai should build that proof early. Film a foundation at the start of a workday and again after an afternoon commute. Show a lipstick after lunch and coffee. Let a creator wear your kajal through a beach evening. Honest footage like this outperforms polished studio shots and protects you from reviews that say the product melted.',
        ],
