          'Everyday Tamil makeup is simpler: kajal, a compact, a lip colour and a pottu. College students and young professionals search for quick looks in Tamil and Tanglish, and short tutorials in Tamil reach them well. Deepavali, Pongal and Tamil New Year suit gift sets and festive shades, so plan kits and creative for each.',
